 "name": "container-aquarium",
 "title": "Container aquarium",
 "author": "Marco Porro",
 "license": "MIT",
 "description": "A fish for every container of your docker panel (the docker community source), green when it is up, amber when unhealthy, red when it stopped. Bubbles follow your network. A container goes down: the glass flashes red and lightning strikes. Click a fish: its name.",
